<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-JALABERT WINS PARIS-NICE OPENING TIME-TRIAL.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-JALABERT WINS PARIS-NICE OPENING TIME-TRIAL.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Laurent Jalabert of France won the opening 7.1 km individual time-trial in the Paris-Nice cycling race on Sunday when he clocked 8 minutes 19 seconds.</p>
</text>
